{"additions":2,"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## v0.15.0\n\n- #182 — Projects: local views from the config — `projects-view \"<name>\" { layout / filter / columns / group-by / sort / fields / board }` joins the project's saved views in the `v` / `V` cycle (`(local)` in the header), `default=#true` opens a board on it; a same-named view replaces across config layers; unknown field names are noticed in the status bar, not errors. The shown view now survives a refresh by number.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w\n","changedFiles":2,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-10T04:42:39Z","deletions":2,"headRefName":"release/0.15.0","labels":[],"number":184,"reviewDecision":"","reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABM7opQg","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe changes are a consistent, verified version bump in both the manifest and lockfile with no functional code modifications.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nBumps the crate version for the v0.15.0 release of `vig`, aligning the package metadata and lockfile entry with the release tag/versioning used across the Rust codebase.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Update `Cargo.toml` package version from `0.14.0` to `0.15.0`.\n- Update the `vig` package entry in `Cargo.lock` to `0.15.0`.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| Cargo.toml | Updates the crate’s published/package version to `0.15.0`. |\r\n| Cargo.lock | Keeps the lockfile’s `vig` package entry consistent with the new version. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 1/2 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 0\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?fi